<div class="page-header">
  <h2>Award History</h2>
  <a href="/award-history/new" class="btn btn-primary">+ Add</a>
</div>
<p class="page-desc">Historical record of won and lost bids — analyze past performance to sharpen future pursuit strategy and document past performance for proposals.</p>

<details class="how-to">
  <summary>How to use Award History</summary>
  <div class="how-to-body">
    <ol>
      <li>Record every contract and grant you have <strong>won or lost</strong> — this builds your official past performance record, which is required in most government proposals.</li>
      <li>For <strong>won awards</strong>: include the contract/grant number, agency or funder, period of performance, award amount, and a brief description of the work performed.</li>
      <li>For <strong>lost bids</strong>: record the reason if known (e.g. price, past performance gap, wrong set-aside) — this helps you improve future proposals.</li>
      <li>When writing a new proposal, filter by Type to quickly find relevant past performance references to include.</li>
    </ol>
    <p>Federal proposals often require 3–5 past performance references. Keeping this list current means you're always ready to pull them without searching old emails or contracts.</p>
  </div>
</details>

<form class="filter-bar" method="GET" action="/award-history">
  <input type="text" name="q" value="<%= filters.q || '' %>" placeholder="Search title or agency…" class="filter-input">
  <select name="award_type" class="filter-select">
    <option value="">All Types</option>
    <% ['Government Contract','Grant','Subcontract','Other'].forEach(function(t) { %>
      <option value="<%= t %>" <%= filters.award_type === t ? 'selected' : '' %>><%= t %></option>
    <% }); %>
  </select>
  <button type="submit" class="btn btn-secondary">Filter</button>
  <a href="/award-history" class="btn-link">Clear</a>
</form>

<% if (awards.length === 0) { %>
  <p class="empty-state">No award history found.</p>
<% } else { %>
  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table class="data-table">
      <thead>
        <tr><th>Title</th><th>Type</th><th>Agency / Funder</th><th>Institution</th><th>Amount</th><th>Period</th><th>Set-Aside</th><th></th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <% awards.forEach(function(a) { %>
          <tr>
            <td><%= a.title %></td>
            <td><span class="badge badge--<%= a.award_type.toLowerCase().replace(' ','-') %>"><%= a.award_type %></span></td>
            <td><%= a.agency_funder || '—' %></td>
            <td><%= a.institution_name || '—' %></td>
            <td><%= a.amount ? '$' + Number(a.amount).toLocaleString('en-US',{maximumFractionDigits:0}) : '—' %></td>
            <td><%= a.period_start ? new Date(a.period_start).toLocaleDateString('en-US',{month:'short',year:'numeric'}) : '—' %></td>
            <td><%= a.set_aside || '—' %></td>
            <td><a href="/award-history/<%= a.id %>/edit" class="btn-link">Edit</a></td>
          </tr>
        <% }); %>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
<% } %>
